{"aaData": [["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-appear-1\" title=\"haǧep\">haǧep</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/appear\" title=\"APPEAR [appear]\">APPEAR [appear]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4238251136\" title=\"1 act[1].V\">1 act[1].V</a>", "often co-occurs with jiinąk, cf. example 473"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-ask-for-1\" title=\"taa\">taa</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/ask-for\" title=\"ASK FOR [ask-for]\">ASK FOR [ask-for]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-be-a-hunter-1\" title=\"no verbal counterpart\">no verbal counterpart</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/be-a-hunter\" title=\"BE A HUNTER [be-a-hunter]\">BE A HUNTER [be-a-hunter]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6883346751\" title=\"N/A\">N/A</a>", "there&#x27;s no verbal counterpart available in the language"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-be-dry-1\" title=\"wuus\">wuus</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/be-dry\" title=\"BE DRY [be-dry]\">BE DRY [be-dry]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6355294063\" title=\"1 und[1].V\">1 und[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-be-hungry-1\" title=\"tookewehi\">tookewehi</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/be-hungry\" title=\"BE HUNGRY [be-hungry]\">BE HUNGRY [be-hungry]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6355294063\" title=\"1 und[1].V\">1 und[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-be-ill-1\" title=\"howaža\">howaža</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/be-ill\" title=\"BE ILL [be-ill]\">BE ILL [be-ill]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4238251136\" title=\"1 act[1].V\">1 act[1].V</a>", "both actor and undergoer inflections are possible"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-be-sad-1\" title=\"horuš&#39;ak\">horuš&#39;ak</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/be-sad\" title=\"BE SAD [be-sad]\">BE SAD [be-sad]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4238251136\" title=\"1 act[1].V\">1 act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-beat-2\" title=\"hirojį\">hirojį</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/beat\" title=\"BEAT [beat]\">BEAT [beat]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6354922871\" title=\"1 2 (3) und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 (3) und[2].act[1].V</a>", "derived verb, see also hojį; hirojį often also means &#x27;throw&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-beat-1\" title=\"hojį\">hojį</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/beat\" title=\"BEAT [beat]\">BEAT [beat]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-blink-1\" title=\"hišjasu gip&#39;is\">hišjasu gip&#39;is</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/blink\" title=\"BLINK [blink]\">BLINK [blink]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4238251136\" title=\"1 act[1].V\">1 act[1].V</a>", "lit. means &#x27;pinch eye&#x27;; Reduplication is used to express iteration of the action."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-boil-1\" title=\"xere\">xere</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/boil\" title=\"BOIL [boil]\">BOIL [boil]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6355294063\" title=\"1 und[1].V\">1 und[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-break-1\" title=\"gišiš\">gišiš</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/break\" title=\"BREAK [break]\">BREAK [break]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-bring-1\" title=\"hanį jii\">hanį jii</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/bring\" title=\"BRING [bring]\">BRING [bring]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "combination of hanį &#x27;have&#x27; + deictic motion verb (=DMV); The meaning BRING can be expressed through the combination of the possessive verb hanį and any of the 12 DMVs, jii is used here just as an example. In this verbal complex he undergoer inflections only occur on hanį , whereas the actor inflections occur on the deictic motion verb as well as on hanį. All derivations (see alternations) only occur on hanį and never on the DMV."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-build-1\" title=\"ųų\">ųų</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/build\" title=\"BUILD [build]\">BUILD [build]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "&#x27;make/do&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-build-2\" title=\"no direct counterpart\">no direct counterpart</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/build\" title=\"BUILD [build]\">BUILD [build]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6883346751\" title=\"N/A\">N/A</a>", "cii&#x27;ų --&gt; cf. ųų"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-burn-1\" title=\"taa&#39;e\">taa&#39;e</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/burn\" title=\"BURN [burn]\">BURN [burn]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6355294063\" title=\"1 und[1].V\">1 und[1].V</a>", "really means &#x27;light/blaze up&#x27;; taaxu = &#x27;be burned&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-carry-1\" title=\"ru&#39;ą\">ru&#39;ą</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/carry\" title=\"CARRY [carry]\">CARRY [carry]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6354998385\" title=\"1 2 (LOC3) und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 (LOC3) und[2].act[1].V</a>", "also means &quot;lift sth. up&quot;; The carrying goal is often not expressed."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-climb-1\" title=\"hoti\">hoti</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/climb\" title=\"CLIMB [climb]\">CLIMB [climb]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-cook-1\" title=\"tuuc hii\">tuuc hii</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/cook\" title=\"COOK [cook]\">COOK [cook]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "consists of v.inact. + v.caus. lit. means &#x27;cause sth. to be cooked&#x27;; tuuc also means &#x27;be ripe&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-cough-1\" title=\"hooxiwi\">hooxiwi</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/cough\" title=\"COUGH [cough]\">COUGH [cough]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4238251136\" title=\"1 act[1].V\">1 act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-cover-1\" title=\"haruką\">haruką</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/cover\" title=\"COVER [cover]\">COVER [cover]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-cry-1\" title=\"ǧaak\">ǧaak</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/cry\" title=\"CRY [cry]\">CRY [cry]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4238251136\" title=\"1 act[1].V\">1 act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-cut-1\" title=\"mąącgis\">mąącgis</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/cut\" title=\"CUT [cut]\">CUT [cut]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "There are many verbs in Hoocąk that can express the meaning &#x27;cut&#x27;, depending on what is cut, how it is cut and what the cut-up pieces look like."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-die-1\" title=\"t&#39;ee\">t&#39;ee</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/die\" title=\"DIE [die]\">DIE [die]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6355294063\" title=\"1 und[1].V\">1 und[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-dig-1\" title=\"k&#39;ee\">k&#39;ee</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/dig\" title=\"DIG [dig]\">DIG [dig]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-dress-1\" title=\"no direct counterpart\">no direct counterpart</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/dress\" title=\"DRESS [dress]\">DRESS [dress]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6883346751\" title=\"N/A\">N/A</a>", "cf. Coercive causative of hikikoroho (GET DRESSED)"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-eat-1\" title=\"ruuc\">ruuc</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/eat\" title=\"EAT [eat]\">EAT [eat]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-fall-1\" title=\"šiipre\">šiipre</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/fall\" title=\"FALL [fall]\">FALL [fall]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6355294063\" title=\"1 und[1].V\">1 und[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-fall-2\" title=\"bookewe\">bookewe</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/fall\" title=\"FALL [fall]\">FALL [fall]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4238251136\" title=\"1 act[1].V\">1 act[1].V</a>", "also means &#x27;trip, stumble&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-fear-1\" title=\"nąąkewe\">nąąkewe</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/fear\" title=\"FEAR [fear]\">FEAR [fear]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "means &#x27;be scared, afraid of&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-feel-cold-1\" title=\"taasak\">taasak</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/feel-cold\" title=\"FEEL COLD [feel-cold]\">FEEL COLD [feel-cold]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6355294063\" title=\"1 und[1].V\">1 und[1].V</a>", "also sįnį = &#x27;be cold&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-feel-pain-1\" title=\"teek\">teek</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/feel-pain\" title=\"FEEL PAIN [feel-pain]\">FEEL PAIN [feel-pain]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6355294063\" title=\"1 und[1].V\">1 und[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-fill-1\" title=\"hoixjį hii\">hoixjį hii</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/fill\" title=\"FILL [fill]\">FILL [fill]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6354922871\" title=\"1 2 (3) und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 (3) und[2].act[1].V</a>", "combination of v.inact. + v.caus. (lexicalized); lit. means &quot;cause sth. to be full&quot;. The filling material can occasionally be expressed, but it is not commonly done so."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-follow-1\" title=\"ruxe\">ruxe</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/follow\" title=\"FOLLOW [follow]\">FOLLOW [follow]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "also (and mostly) means &#x27;chase&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-frighten-1\" title=\"nąąǧire hii\">nąąǧire hii</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/frighten\" title=\"FRIGHTEN [frighten]\">FRIGHTEN [frighten]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "consists of v.inact.+v.caus. lit. means &#x27;make so. be afraid, be frightened&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-get-dressed-1\" title=\"hikikoroho\">hikikoroho</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/get-dressed\" title=\"GET DRESSED [get-dressed]\">GET DRESSED [get-dressed]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4238251136\" title=\"1 act[1].V\">1 act[1].V</a>", "means &#x27;get oneself ready&#x27;; hikoroho = &#x27;get ready&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-get-1\" title=\"harucap\">harucap</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/get\" title=\"GET [get]\">GET [get]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "(no direct match); means &#x27;grab, seize&#x27; but can also have the reading &#x27;receive&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-give-1\" title=\"hok&#39;ų\">hok&#39;ų</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/give\" title=\"GIVE [give]\">GIVE [give]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/7374704735\" title=\"1 2 3 und[3].und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 3 und[3].und[2].act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-go-1\" title=\"no direct counterpart\">no direct counterpart</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/go\" title=\"GO [go]\">GO [go]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6883346751\" title=\"N/A\">N/A</a>", "it is difficult to find a direct counterpart to this meaning label. There are 12 deictic motion verbs in Hoocąk with inherently complex semantics, neither of which seems to be suited for the purpose of this study."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-grind-2\" title=\"mąąxjuk\">mąąxjuk</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/grind\" title=\"GRIND [grind]\">GRIND [grind]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "kind of means &#x27;pulverize with a sharp instrument&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-grind-1\" title=\"gicop\">gicop</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/grind\" title=\"GRIND [grind]\">GRIND [grind]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "more commonly means &#x27;chop&#x27;, it&#x27;s difficult to find a word that just means &#x27;grind&#x27;."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-hear-1\" title=\"nąąxgų\">nąąxgų</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/hear\" title=\"HEAR [hear]\">HEAR [hear]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "can also mean &#x27;understand, listen&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-help-1\" title=\"gijire\">gijire</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/help\" title=\"HELP [help]\">HELP [help]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-hide-1\" title=\"nųųxąwą\">nųųxąwą</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/hide\" title=\"HIDE [hide]\">HIDE [hide]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "This verb often occurs in complex verbal expressions, i.e. it is mostly followed by other verbs (e.g. verbs of motion or verbs meaning &#x27;put&#x27;)."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-hit-1\" title=\"hapa\">hapa</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/hit\" title=\"HIT [hit]\">HIT [hit]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "also means &#x27;touch, make contact with sth., strike&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-hug-1\" title=\"nąąt&#39;ųp\">nąąt&#39;ųp</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/hug\" title=\"HUG [hug]\">HUG [hug]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-jump-1\" title=\"t&#39;ąąp\">t&#39;ąąp</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/jump\" title=\"JUMP [jump]\">JUMP [jump]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4238251136\" title=\"1 act[1].V\">1 act[1].V</a>", "often used with jikere &#x27;do suddenly&#x27;; reduplicated version is preferred as the unreduplicated form can also mean &#x27;get off (the bus, the car etc.)&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-kill-1\" title=\"t&#39;ee hii\">t&#39;ee hii</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/kill\" title=\"KILL [kill]\">KILL [kill]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "combination of v.inact. + v.caus. lit. means &quot;cause to die&quot;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-know-1\" title=\"hiperes\">hiperes</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/know\" title=\"KNOW [know]\">KNOW [know]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "second argument slot is often filled with a complement clause"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-laugh-1\" title=\"hikša\">hikša</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/laugh\" title=\"LAUGH [laugh]\">LAUGH [laugh]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4238251136\" title=\"1 act[1].V\">1 act[1].V</a>", "also means &#x27;smile&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-leave-1\" title=\"no direct counterpart\">no direct counterpart</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/leave\" title=\"LEAVE [leave]\">LEAVE [leave]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6883346751\" title=\"N/A\">N/A</a>", "cf. COME"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-like-1\" title=\"gipį\">gipį</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/like\" title=\"LIKE [like]\">LIKE [like]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-live-1\" title=\"cii\">cii</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/live\" title=\"LIVE [live]\">LIVE [live]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6355572301\" title=\"1 LOC2 act[1].V\">1 LOC2 act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-load-1\" title=\"hožu\">hožu</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/load\" title=\"LOAD [load]\">LOAD [load]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/8396097647\" title=\"1 2 LOC3 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 LOC3 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "means &#x27;put in&#x27;, was originally derived from the verb žuu &#x27;put&#x27;, but 