</a>", "also means &#x27;hunt (for) sth.&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-see-1\" title=\"haja\">haja</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/see\" title=\"SEE [see]\">SEE [see]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-send-1\" title=\"no direct counterpart\">no direct counterpart</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/send\" title=\"SEND [send]\">SEND [send]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6883346751\" title=\"N/A\">N/A</a>", "there is no real counterpart to this meaning label. A combination of DMV (deictic motion verb) + CAUS are the most likely renderings of this meaning (see example sentences)."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-shave-self-1\" title=\"iihį gik&#39;o\">iihį gik&#39;o</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/shave-self\" title=\"SHAVE (self) [shave-self]\">SHAVE (self) [shave-self]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4238251136\" title=\"1 act[1].V\">1 act[1].V</a>", "lit. means &quot;scrape mouth-hair&quot;; Its most common usage is with the possessive reflexive."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-shout-at-1\" title=\"wąą\">wąą</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/shout-at\" title=\"SHOUT AT [shout-at]\">SHOUT AT [shout-at]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4238251136\" title=\"1 act[1].V\">1 act[1].V</a>", "not a direct counterpart, really means &#x27;holler&#x27;, often used with rehii &#x27;do quickly&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-show-1\" title=\"waha\">waha</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/show\" title=\"SHOW [show]\">SHOW [show]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-sing-1\" title=\"nąąwą\">nąąwą</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/sing\" title=\"SING [sing]\">SING [sing]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-sink-1\" title=\"hasaware\">hasaware</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/sink\" title=\"SINK [sink]\">SINK [sink]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6355294063\" title=\"1 und[1].V\">1 und[1].V</a>", "also means &#x27;drown&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-sit-down-1\" title=\"mįįnak\">mįįnak</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/sit-down\" title=\"SIT DOWN [sit-down]\">SIT DOWN [sit-down]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6355572301\" title=\"1 LOC2 act[1].V\">1 LOC2 act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-sit-1\" title=\"mįįnak\">mįįnak</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/sit\" title=\"SIT [sit]\">SIT [sit]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6355572301\" title=\"1 LOC2 act[1].V\">1 LOC2 act[1].V</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/hoch1243-smell-1\" title=\"horupąną\">horupąną</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/smell\" title=\"SMELL [smell]\">SMELL [smell]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/4237270435\" title=\"1 2 und[2].act[1].V\">1 2 und[2].act[1].V</a>", "neutral meaning